By Lemma~\ref{lemma:level}, this $\ell$-ladder is level, hence $\End((E_i,\iota_i))
= \End((F_i,\iota_i'))$.

The $\ell$-isogeny chain $(F_i)$ is sent to Bob, who chooses a horizontal smooth
endomorphism $\psi_B$,
and sends the resulting $\ell$-isogeny chain $(G_i)$ to Alice.  Each applies (and, eventually, push forward) the
private endomorphism to obtain $(H_i) = \psi_B \cdot (F_i) = \psi_A \cdot (G_i)$, and
$H = H_n$ is the shared secret.

