+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2012.10803.
+
+The paper represents the ring class group of ``O_d = Z + 2^d Z[i]`` by
+
+    (Z[i] / 2^d Z[i])^* / (Z[i])^* (Z / 2^d Z)^*.
+
+This module asks for the bounded exponent vector of a product of oriented
+split-prime classes in that quotient.  An instance is inverse-generated: the
+exponents are sampled first, independent Gaussian-prime representatives are
+then sampled, and their quotient-class product becomes the public target.
+
+The verifier multiplies Gaussian residues modulo ``2^d`` and compares quotient
+classes exactly.  It never reads ``inst["answer"]``.  Importing this module has
+no I/O, network access, global-random use, or printing side effects.
+"""
