The full suite is still in the exact LLL panel; this is the intentionally expensive baseline rather than a hang. Each audit derives the public discrete logs first and then reduces a 42-dimensional integer lattice, so the report will include both the smooth preprocessing cost and the remaining subset-sum cost separately.
