Rejected rather than shipped.

The inverse-generated exponent family passed G and V, with zero hits in 200,000 guesses and six attacks failing on 8/8 seeds. However:

- Track A is unsupported without testing the stronger known BKZ/relation-lattice attack against OSIDH parameters.
- Track B has no compact recovery route.
- Honest witness recovery needs at least 459,092 exact operations before the remaining subset-sum search, exceeding G9(c)’s 300-operation cap. The earlier 242 count measured verification only.

This agrees with the paper’s smooth class-group construction and later practical security analysis. [Original paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.10803), [PKC 2022 security analysis](https://www.iacr.org/archive/pkc2022/131770037/131770037.pdf).

